            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Female scientist in protective gear holds a red test tube in a modern laboratory, with microscope and monitor in the background.\" data-id=\"2296493428\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2296493428/image_2296493428.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Thitaporn Yaroteak/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p>The last time I spoke about Nektar Therapeutics (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NKTR\" title=\"Nektar Therapeutics\">NKTR</a></span>) it was with a <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4936885-nektar-maintaining-strong-buy-rating-due-to-rezpeg-catalyst-another-coming\">Seeking Alpha article</a> entitled \"<em>Nektar: Maintaining 'Strong Buy' Rating Due To REZPEG Catalyst, Another Coming</em>.\" With respect</p></body></html>",
